#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Trezor akreditiva"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Datoteka ključa trezora"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored credentials. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write (the same applies to credential files); the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored credentials must be entered again."
msgstr "Apsolutna putanja do 32-bajtnog ključa koji šifrira pohranjene akreditive. Kreirajte je sami, izvan korijena weba, čitljivu samo korisniku web servera i pollera, u direktoriju u koji mogu pisati samo root i taj korisnik (isto važi i za datoteke akreditiva); dodatak je nikad ne kreira niti zapisuje. Napravite sigurnosnu kopiju zajedno s bazom podataka: bez nje pohranjeni akreditivi moraju biti ponovo uneseni."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential File Directory"
msgstr "Direktorij datoteka akreditiva"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the directory that holds credential files. An account can read its credential from a file only inside it, never the vault key file. Empty, the default, refuses credential files. Cloud Admin chooses the file, so keep only cloud credentials here."
msgstr "Apsolutna putanja do direktorija koji sadrži datoteke akreditiva. Nalog može pročitati svoj akreditiv iz datoteke samo unutar tog direktorija, nikad iz datoteke ključa trezora. Prazno, što je podrazumijevano, odbija datoteke akreditiva. Administrator oblaka bira datoteku, stoga ovdje držite samo akreditive za oblak."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Kolektor"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Vremenski budžet kolektora"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new work. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished accounts resume on the next run."
msgstr "Broj sekundi koje jedno pokretanje kolektora smije potrošiti prije nego prestane započinjati novi rad. Držite ga ispod intervala pollera; nedovršeni nalozi nastavljaju pri sljedećem pokretanju."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Deinstalacija"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Zadrži tabele dodatka pri deinstalaciji"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its accounts, encrypted credentials, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Cloud resources are never touched either way."
msgstr "Kada je označeno, deinstalacija dodatka zadržava njegove naloge, šifrirane akreditive i keš. Poništite izbor kako bi ih deinstalacija uklonila. Resursi u oblaku se u oba slučaja nikad ne diraju."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "Not verified yet."
msgstr "Još nije provjereno."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works and has the permissions this account needs."
msgstr "Akreditiv radi i ima dozvole koje ovaj nalog zahtijeva."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider rejected the credential. It may be wrong, expired, or revoked."
msgstr "Provajder je odbio akreditiv. Možda je pogrešan, istekao ili opozvan."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works but lacks a permission this account needs."
msgstr "Akreditiv radi, ali mu nedostaje dozvola koju ovaj nalog zahtijeva."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider could not be reached. Check the network path and outbound policy from the poller."
msgstr "Provajder nije bio dostupan. Provjerite mrežnu putanju i pravila odlaznog saobraćaja s pollera."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider is throttling requests. Try again later."
msgstr "Provajder ograničava brzinu zahtjeva. Pokušajte ponovo kasnije."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider sent a response the plugin could not read."
msgstr "Provajder je poslao odgovor koji dodatak nije mogao pročitati."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The account or its credential is not configured correctly."
msgstr "Nalog ili njegov akreditiv nije ispravno konfigurisan."

